1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,930
(2 Months Later)

2
00:00:05,759 --> 00:00:09,459
When he actually focuses in class…
he looks insanely cute.

3
00:00:17,199 --> 00:00:19,816
I never thought these two months
would feel this long.

4
00:00:25,199 --> 00:00:27,895
I don't get it— where did this number go?

5
00:00:27,895 --> 00:00:29,636
How did it suddenly become 2y?

6
00:00:29,826 --> 00:00:31,612
And this line?
Where did this even come from?

7
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,942
I swear I explained this as clearly as possible.

8
00:00:37,894 --> 00:00:41,550
If I restart everything from the basics,
we won't have enough time.

9
00:00:48,559 --> 00:00:54,866
Book, what do you want me to do?
I barely keep up in class— passing is a miracle already.

10
00:00:54,866 --> 00:00:56,950
Just help me get *one* question right.
Please.

11
00:00:58,695 --> 00:01:03,808
No way. You're my boyfriend—
you have to aim higher.

12
00:01:03,919 --> 00:01:06,699
You go for "almost top."
I'll take the top spot, okay?

13
00:01:08,555 --> 00:01:11,079
Let me rest for a bit first, please.

14
00:01:13,078 --> 00:01:17,208
Okay. Want cold water? Or milk?

15
00:01:19,191 --> 00:01:25,035
Grab the iced coffee in the fridge.
And that orange painkiller tablet on top of the cabinet.

16
00:01:27,462 --> 00:01:31,129
Smart move—
coffee and painkillers together.

17
00:01:33,810 --> 00:01:38,494
Hurry back, okay? After tutoring,
we still have *other homework* to do.

18
00:01:40,430 --> 00:01:44,383
Idiot— if we don't finish this,
don't even think about anything else.
